se fabric may show through slightly at the seams and folds (sleeve cuffs, hems, or hoods). This is an expected result of the printing process.\r\nIn case of low fabric stock, we might use comparable fabric to fulfill the order. The substitute will be as close to the original as possible.\r\nProduct code: #717\r\n\r\nThis product is made on demand. No minimums.',51.00,NULL,1100,'products/5PTfL4Hax9ZtCE4i6mLnTmKhOO6Tqk9bSq8l90Yx.webp',NULL,1,0,1,'{\"left\":0.4,\"top\":0,\"width\":0.1,\"height\":0.1}','2026-05-14 20:58:22','2026-05-14 21:01:50'),(62,10,'variable','[{\"key\":\"size\",\"label\":\"Size\",\"values\":[\"2Xl\",\"2XS\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\",\"5XL\",\"6XL\",\"L\",\"M\",\"S\",\"XL\",\"XS\"]},{\"key\":\"color\",\"label\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"White\"]}]','All-Over Print Unisex Cotton Hoodie','all-over-print-unisex-cotton-hoodie','ALLOVERPRINTUNISEXCOTTONHOOD','Elevate your casual style with this premium cotton hoodie. Designed for leisure and streetwear, it combines a relaxed unisex fit with a clean drop-shoulder cut. The all-over print allows you to create unique, bold designs that cover the entire garment, making it a standout piece for any collection.\r\n\r\n95% cotton, 5% elastane\r\nFabric weight: 7.8 oz./yd.² (265 g/m²)\r\nSoft and comfortable feel\r\nRelaxed fit\r\nDrop shoulders for a modern silhouette\r\nDouble-layer hood with drawstrings\r\nSpacious front pocket for everyday essentials\r\nSelf-fabric collar and cuffs\r\nTear-away care label\r\nBlank product sourced from Mexico\r\nDisclaimers:\r\n\r\nAvoid large solid fills of dark or saturated colors. These areas require more ink, which can make the fabric feel stiff on first wear and appear slightly muted after printing. Lighter tones use less ink and feel softer on first wear, but you are not limited to them.\r\nTo reduce stiffness, use patterns or designs with negative space instead of solid fills. Less ink makes the fabric feel softer and more breathable.\r\nExpect slightly muted color results compared to digital previews or sublimation prints. Cotton absorbs ink differently, so the fabric’s texture may show through the print, adding a soft, matte finish.\r\nWhen stretched, printed areas may show fine cracks or the white base fabric, especially at seams, cuffs, or tight spots. This is normal for flexible cotton garments.\r\nPrint results may vary slightly by garment thickness. Thicker fabrics absorb ink differently from lighter items.\r\nWe can’t guarantee a 100% black color match between a pre-colored black fabric and fabric that’s been colored black in the direct-to-fabric printing process. On larger surfaces, the black may appear slightly gray.\r\nProduct code: 140CO\r\n\r\nThis product is made on demand. No minimums.',45.00,NULL,1050,'products/D38qMSiYejlo17zJUy81xaHKTfFYizG2hJZ8RhEh.webp',NULL,1,0,1,'{\"left\":0.4,\"top\":0,\"width\":0.1,\"height\":0.1}','2026-05-14 22:08:47','2026-05-14 22:12:14'),(63,10,'variable','[{\"key\":\"size\",\"label\":\"Size\",\"values\":[\"2Xl\",\"L\",\"M\",\"S\",\"XL\"]},{\"key\":\"color\",\"label\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Army\",\"Black\",\"Burgundy\",\"Coal\",\"Ecru\",\"Grey Marle\",\"Navy\",\"Pink\",\"White\",\"White Marle\"]}]','AS Colour 5161 I Unisex Oversized Hoodie','as-colour-5161-i-unisex-oversized-hoodie','ASCOLOUR5161IUNISEXOVERSIZED','The AS Colour 5161 oversized hoodie is made with heavyweight cotton and brushed fleece for max comfort. Its roomy fit and streetwear cut make it perfect for layering or making a bold impression. Add your branding to this custom oversized hoodie and give your collection a modern edge.\r\n\r\n80% cotton, 20% recycled polyester fleece\r\nFabric weight: 9.4 oz./yd.² (319 g/m²)\r\nRelaxed fit\r\nLined pullover hood with no drawcord\r\nDropped shoulders\r\nKangaroo pocket in front\r\nSleeve cuff ribbing\r\nTear-away tag\r\nBlank product sourced from Vietnam\r\nDisclaimer: The brushed interior of this hoodie tends to shed. To reduce visible traces of lint on clothes, avoid wearing dark colors